  "analysis": "I see four scripts: collect_data.sh (permission --wx--x--x, odd), generate_report.sh (rwxr-xr-x), process_data.sh (rw-r--r--, no execute), and run_pipeline.sh (rw-r--r--, no execute). The main script run_pipeline.sh doesn't have execute permission. Let me examine each script's contents and check for line ending issues.",
  "plan": "I'll examine each script's content using cat -A to check for Windows line endings and read the logic. Then I'll fix issues like missing execute permissions, line endings, and any logic problems.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat -A run_pipeline.sh\n",
